sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Actor
    participant file as HoneyDoc
    participant win as Windows auditing
    participant wazuh as Wazuh
    participant janus as JANUS collector
    participant db as Evidence registry
    participant canary as Canarytokens
    participant analyst as Defender

    actor->>file: Interact with decoy
    file->>win: Audited access right is exercised
    win->>wazuh: Security event 4663 (+ optional context)
    wazuh->>janus: Matching JANUS alert
    janus->>janus: Match active path, normalize action, score verdict
    janus->>db: Store raw alert, SHA-256, normalized signal
    janus-->>analyst: Local dashboard detection
    opt Format-specific remote activation
        file-->>canary: Office request or AWS API key use
        canary-->>analyst: Provider email / webhook
    end
    Note over analyst: Local and remote signals retain separate provenance

